# LightMoss: Bluetooth. spruce starts bluetoothd and bluealsa (systemctl, as
# on dArkMoss) when its Bluetooth setting is on, and stops them when it is
# off. Enabled, they would start whenever the adapter appears
# (bluetooth.target), whatever the setting.
disable bluetooth.service
disable bluealsa.service
# bluealsa-aplay plays what a phone streams to this handheld: not wanted.
disable bluealsa-aplay.service
